# Build artifacts
/target
**/target

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copyrighted material must NEVER be committed. See docs/LEGAL.md.
# The `extracted/` directory is where a user drops files taken from a disc
# they own (SLUS_209.25, GODOFWAR.TOC, PART*.PAK, ...). Nothing in here is
# tracked by git; the loaders take these as command line paths.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
